{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CountingSemiring"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sj","text":"Numeric"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With unit weights, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dagShortestDistances"},{"text":" counts the paths. With other weights it sums, over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every path, the product of the path’s weights, which is the probability semiring when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"weights are probabilities.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"zero"},{"text":" is 0, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"one"},{"text":" is 1, ⊕ is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"+"},{"text":" and ⊗ is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"text":". It is not selective, because ⊕ is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"idempotent (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a ⊕ a == 2a"},{"text":"), and not ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"text":", so only ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dagShortestDistances"},{"text":" takes it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Over ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" both operations trap on overflow, like every sum in ShortestPaths, because a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saturated or wrapped count would be silently wrong. ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int.max","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" paths fit: 2⁶³ − 1, or 2³¹ − 1 where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is 32 bits. ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rounds past 2⁵³.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For exact large counts, use any ","type":"text"},{"code":"Numeric & Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" big-integer type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["dag.dagShortestDistances(from: s) { _ in CountingSemiring(1) }"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:9Semirings16CountingSemiringV","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"CountingSemiring","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Semirings\/CountingSemiring.swift#L17","fileName":"CountingSemiring.swift"},"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CountingSemiring","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Semirings"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CountingSemiring","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/Semiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SQ","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SH","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/semirings\/countingsemiring"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/